  "solution": "Let\n\nConsider A as '+'\n\nConsider B as '×' \n\nConsider C as '-'\n\nSo,\n\n35 A 18 B 5 C 10 = 115 ⇒ 35 + 18 × 5 - 10 = 115\n\n⇒ 35 + __**18 × 5**__ - 10 = 115\n\n⇒ __**35 + 90**__ - 10 = 115\n\n⇒ __**1**____**25 - 10**__ = 115\n\n⇒ 115 = 115 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd, \n\n41 A 23 B 7 C 15 = 187 ⇒ 41 + 23 × 7 - 15 = 187\n\n⇒ 41 + __**23 × 7**__ - 15 = 187\n\n⇒ __**41 + 161**__ - 15 = 187\n\n⇒ __**202 - 15**__ = 187\n\n⇒ 187 = 187 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n8 A 4 B 5 C 9 = ? ⇒ 8 + 4 × 5 - 9 = ?\n\n⇒ 8 + __**4 × 5**__ - 9 = ?\n\n⇒ __**8 + 20**__ - 9 = ?\n\n⇒ __**28 - 9**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **19**\n\nHence, **\"Option 2\"** is the correct answer.",
